    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f4b171e859022762b7a6819",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这与单纯的尊敬截然不同。那信念如岩石间的宝石般澄澈，\n不含一丝阴霾。对西沙里奥而言，所谓『老师』就是――",
      "source_fingerprint": "4eb9e84fbc8cccdf5bcd43bc24149b9e3e9a0bdafe381143442887aa937484d6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1110/storytimeline_041110002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        30,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/30/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d9837916efb921cae3f0c952",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "西沙里奥",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b7ea8f429e376dcab41bee5b946ee4fb9dc8e928a406a356926b617ad6aaffb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1110/storytimeline_041110002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        31,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/31/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:860622dee0a703f94a18cba6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "其实……是的。父母从事着与赛马娘培育相关的工作，\n我从小就看着母亲指导后辈的身影长大。",
      "source_fingerprint": "91c3ba83af3c081bd05eb29a56c7332fcdfb2de81f1b876e1af0473811733359",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1110/storytimeline_041110002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        31,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/31/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c00e22453391481ef74cd25c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "西沙里奥",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b7ea8f429e376dcab41bee5b946ee4fb9dc8e928a406a356926b617ad6aaffb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1110/storytimeline_041110002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        32,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/32/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db70b232e96fa8d496e2dc0b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "凭冲动跑得摇摇晃晃的孩子，在母亲的引导下\n学会了奔跑方式，找到了名为比赛的生存之道……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e30e0712f54adb687d711a2de0976cfe6b77ce5fdb8fa4d3bc5964171e3df5db",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1110/storytimeline_041110002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        32,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/32/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e9ddd9fbfcbc951980ef7cee",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "你找到了属于自己的跑法呢",
      "source_fingerprint": "bde3a8d647b388a7d38a06f64b6b697729461da114a69672791af7a587d0c978",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1110/storytimeline_041110002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        33,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/33/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8956ee0be1c7db9e10f641b7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "你找到了属于自己的跑法呢",
      "source_fingerprint": "bde3a8d647b388a7d38a06f64b6b697729461da114a69672791af7a587d0c978",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
