      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/35/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2ac64697bf9ff9a6733a6bed",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我既然作为赛马娘出生，也想成为那股伟大洪流的一部分。\n以『老师』的身份引导许多赛马娘……最后，成为『基石』――",
      "source_fingerprint": "7515444fee7b75dc2b100672421e9191f5e5b16817ab8a6b2411940926ebba89",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1110/storytimeline_041110002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        35,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/35/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:948d018c63f0318d84df253c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "西沙里奥",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b7ea8f429e376dcab41bee5b946ee4fb9dc8e928a406a356926b617ad6aaffb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1110/storytimeline_041110002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        36,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/36/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f2f99f14a5aefa1ccd6ade29",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "！！合适吗？真的？训练员也这么觉得？\n哇…………！啊，呵呵…………好开心……！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "319ebf17e2a61bfad40e9ccb7fcc232af92adb2795a6762a8fc05c84851ac0d7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1110/storytimeline_041110002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
