    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8a3d3a697dc2ba906ba0b4b6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "是的。像那样倾力指导后辈的身姿，\n对我来说堪称典范。",
      "source_fingerprint": "aba36213410d978076c52c72592d1b28c9d8c5a0d27e19ff58bccc349f37ef02",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
