    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e76ee20ea20ca48480b6e298",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我觉得这很有道理。气槽也是选择了后冠路线，\n从『橡树大赛』的胜利开始，创下了辉煌战绩的赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ecb501731586ef468be28d58cf879245682fb80ef5a9bb5baf29b4adce86717",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1110/storytimeline_041110003.json",
      "json_path": [
