      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "气槽同学曾在『橡树大赛』实现母女两代制霸。\n她将奔跑从母亲手中继承下来，再传承下去的姿态很有说服力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d60000b1f51f75b128e5dfd9b72edb212fac4494fce6e028317bbe1333067d03",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
